---
// Background: a flat paper colour. The old drifting orbs, grid and grain were removed
// so the surface reads as material rather than effect. The file is kept so Base.astro
// does not need to change.
---

<div class="ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
	.ambient {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: -1;
		pointer-events: none;
		background: var(--color-paper);
	}
</style>
